# Deliberately committed. Nothing here is a secret: this is a static site,
# so every value below is compiled into the JavaScript that ships to the
# browser and can be read by anyone. Keeping it in the repo means a fresh
# clone still builds a site that delivers leads and reports analytics —
# an untracked file would go missing and silently reintroduce that defect.
#
# NEVER add a real credential here. See .env.example for what each var is.

VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEYS=
VITE_LEAD_ENDPOINT=
VITE_GA4_ID=G-XG6LEK04KT
